{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"family"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Comp"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"requires"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"comp"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Comp"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"excludesAll"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"excludedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","text":"Component"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type...) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS6FamilyV","text":"Family"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Comp"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Comp"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","text":"Component"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Component type required by members of this family."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"comp"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All component types that must not be assigned to an entity in this family."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"excludedComponents"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The family of entities having 1 required components each."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A family is a collection of entities with uniform component types per entity."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Entities that are be part of this family will have at least the 1 required components,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but may have more components assigned."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A family is just a view on (component) data, creating them is cheap."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use them to iterate efficiently over entities with the same components assigned."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Families with the same requirements provide a view on the same collection of entities (aka members)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A family conforms to the "},{"code":"LazySequenceProtocol","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and therefore can be accessed like any other (lazy) sequence."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"General usage"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let family = nexus.family(requires: Comp1.self)","\/\/ iterate each entity's components","family.forEach { (comp1) in","  ...","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Caveats"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Component types must be unique per family"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Component type order is arbitrary"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(1) for existing families, O(N) where N is the number of entities for new families.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Complexit